    "Remote Control": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspaces": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every workspace this app can be in — on this Mac and on remote machines. Selecting one scopes the whole app to it; drag to reorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用可进入的全部工作区 — 本机与远程机器。点选一项会将整个应用切到该工作区；可拖拽排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every workspace on this Mac has its own sessions, projects, presets, and settings. Selecting one scopes this window to it; drag to reorder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机上的每个工作区都有各自的会话、项目、预设和设置。点选一项会将本窗口切到该工作区；可拖拽排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All workspaces": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the color dot to set a workspace's color, or the ⋯ menu to rename or remove it. Drag to reorder — the sidebar switcher matches. Add Workspace… covers this Mac, pairing, and SSH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击色点设置工作区颜色，或用 ⋯ 菜单重命名/移除。拖拽排序会与侧栏切换器一致。「添加工作区…」覆盖本机、配对和 SSH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a workspace to select it. Set each one's color with its dot, use the ⋯ menu to rename or remove it, and drag to reorder — the sidebar switcher matches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击工作区即可选中。用色点设置颜色，用 ⋯ 菜单重命名或移除，拖拽排序会与侧栏切换器一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Workspace…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建工作区…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重命名工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows in the menu bar and on paired phones. The phone name fully updates after the workspace restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示在菜单栏和已配对的手机上。手机上的名称会在工作区重启后完全更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove and delete its data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除并删除其数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Remove from list\" keeps %1$@'s data at %2$@ so you can re-add it later. Deleting its data also unpairs any phones paired with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「从列表移除」会保留 %1$@ 在 %2$@ 的数据，之后还可重新添加。删除数据同时会解除与其配对的手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %1$@'s Remote Control settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 %1$@ 的远程控制设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set %1$@'s color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 %1$@ 的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit %@ before removing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先退出 %@，再移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add iPhone or iPad…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 iPhone 或 iPad…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget Workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "忘记工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extra workspaces require Unpeel Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额外工作区需要 Unpeel Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel Link adds workspaces, remote control from your iPhone, and Unpeel Remote access from anywhere — $59 per seat per year.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel Link 提供工作区、iPhone 远程控制，以及随时随地的 Unpeel Remote 访问 — 每席位每年 $59。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Unpeel Link Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Unpeel Link 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App color for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的应用配色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Washes %1$@'s window chrome and shows on its paired phones. Any other workspace's color is set from its row's dot in the list above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 %1$@ 的窗口铬层着色，并显示在其已配对的手机上。其他工作区的颜色可在上方列表对应行的色点设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not shared": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未共享"
          }
