      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback & bugs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反馈与缺陷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Unpeel looks. System follows your macOS appearance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 的外观。跟随系统即与 macOS 外观一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to the window, sidebar and terminal colors. Claude Code has its own theme setting — run /config inside Claude Code and change Theme to match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用于窗口、侧栏和终端颜色。Claude Code 有自己的主题设置 — 在 Claude Code 内运行 /config，将 Theme 改成一致即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Washes this workspace's window chrome — sidebar, content, and terminal canvas. Each workspace keeps its own color (also editable per workspace in Settings ▸ Workspaces).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为此工作区的窗口铬层着色 — 侧栏、内容区和终端画布。每个工作区各自保留颜色（也可在 设置 ▸ 工作区 中按工作区编辑）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session titles": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What names a session in the sidebar until you rename it. First prompt titles it once from your first message. Live from agent follows the agent's own task summary as it works (agents that publish one — Claude today), falling back to the first prompt until it appears. Renaming a session always wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "侧栏中会话在你重命名之前的显示名称。首次提示用你的第一条消息命名一次。跟随智能体则采用智能体发布的任务摘要（目前 Claude 会发布），在出现前回退到首次提示。手动重命名始终优先。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First prompt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live from agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transparency": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Surface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revert to default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background is the window backdrop — the sidebar and everything behind the content; below 100% the desktop shows through it, natively blurred. Surface covers the terminal canvas, settings, and the other pages on top of it. 100% is fully opaque. Terminal text always stays fully opaque.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景是窗口衬底 — 侧栏以及内容背后的一切；低于 100% 时桌面会透过并带系统模糊。表层覆盖其上的终端画布、设置等页面。100% 为完全不透明。终端文字始终保持不透明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open resources": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开资源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Editor": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what opens each supported type in this workspace. The editor is also used by \"Open in editor\" and the titlebar open button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择此工作区中各受支持类型用什么打开。编辑器也用于「在编辑器中打开」和标题栏打开按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建终端"
          }
        }
      }
