    "Presence": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How you appear to others connected to the same Host — the name and avatar on presence chips.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在同一 Host 上向他人展示的方式 — 在线状态芯片上的名称与头像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel Link is active": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel Link 已激活"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licensed to": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许可给"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seats": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "席位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d Hosts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 个 Host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deactivating…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在停用…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deactivate this Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停用此 Host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release seat": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "释放席位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel Link subscription": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel Link 订阅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One compatibility seat activates one Host. Deactivating frees this Host's seat so you can use the key on a different machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个兼容席位激活一个 Host。停用可释放此 Host 的席位，以便在其他机器上使用密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Unpeel Link key is no longer active": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Unpeel Link 密钥已不再有效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subscription for %@ has ended or been refunded. Unpeel keeps working — renew or enter a different key to use Unpeel Link again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的订阅已结束或已退款。Unpeel 仍可继续使用 — 续订或输入其他密钥以再次使用 Unpeel Link。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel Remote": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel Remote"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reach your Macs from anywhere over an end-to-end encrypted relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过端到端加密中继从任何地方访问你的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone remote control": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 远程控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair the Unpeel iOS app to steer sessions from your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对 Unpeel iOS 应用，从手机操控会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run separate Unpeel instances with their own sessions and settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行独立的 Unpeel 实例，各有自己的会话与设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Unpeel Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取 Unpeel Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel is free on your Mac; Link is the relay above — $59 per seat per year, one compatibility seat activates one Host. Paste the key from your purchase email to activate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 在 Mac 上免费；Link 是上方所述中继 — 每席位每年 $59，一个兼容席位激活一个 Host。粘贴购买邮件中的密钥即可激活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lost your key?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "丢失密钥？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activating…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在激活…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "激活"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expires in %d:%02d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "于 %d:%02d 后过期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an iPhone or iPad to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向 %@ 添加 iPhone 或 iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac forwards a one-time sealed exchange to the remote workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机会将一次性密封交换转发到远程工作区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device added to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备已添加到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone now has its own revocable Direct and Link credentials for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机现已拥有针对 %@ 的可撤销 Direct 与 Link 凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Another iPhone or iPad": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再添加一台 iPhone 或 iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan this code in Unpeel on the phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在手机的 Unpeel 中扫描此码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone only needs to reach this Mac for the one-time sealed exchange. The remote workspace creates the credentials; this Mac forwards the sealed response without opening it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机只需在一次性密封交换期间连到本机。远程工作区创建凭据；本机转发密封响应而不打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creating invitation…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在创建邀请…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Generate QR Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成二维码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh QR Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刷新二维码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Pairing Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After pairing, the phone connects to %@ itself—Direct when reachable, otherwise through Unpeel Link if enabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对后，手机自行连接 %@ — 可达时用 Direct，否则在启用时经 Unpeel Link。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby or code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近或配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new workspace on this Mac, or one on another machine you control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机新建工作区，或在你控制的另一台机器上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new, separate workspace on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机新建一个独立工作区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kind": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspace name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作区名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts blank, fully separate from this workspace: its own sessions, projects, presets, and settings, and it pairs with your phone as its own Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从空白开始，与此工作区完全分离：自有会话、项目、预设和设置，并以独立 Mac 与手机配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Created workspaces appear in the workspace switcher; renaming never moves their data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建的工作区会出现在工作区切换器中；重命名不会移动其数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby discovery is unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近发现不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can still paste the pairing code below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你仍可在下方粘贴配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workspaces on your network appear here. On the other machine, run `unpeel serve` (or open Unpeel).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络上的工作区会显示在此。在另一台机器上运行 `unpeel serve`（或打开 Unpeel）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use pairing code only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the other machine, run `unpeel pair` — or `unpeel pair --serve` to start serving at the same time — then enter the code it shows here. For another Mac running the Unpeel app, its code is in Settings ▸ Remote Control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在另一台机器上运行 `unpeel pair` — 或 `unpeel pair --serve` 同时开始服务 — 然后在此输入显示的码。运行 Unpeel 应用的另一台 Mac，其码在 设置 ▸ 远程控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codes work once and expire after 5 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对码仅用一次，5 分钟后过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSH destination": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "user@host or SSH config alias": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "user@host 或 SSH 配置别名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel uses your system SSH configuration, keys, agent, host-key policy, ProxyJump, and VPN. Put ports and identity files in ~/.ssh/config.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 使用系统 SSH 配置、密钥、代理、主机密钥策略、ProxyJump 和 VPN。端口与身份文件请写在 ~/.ssh/config。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password or API key (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码或 API 密钥（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave empty for SSH keys or agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 SSH 密钥或代理时留空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved in this Mac’s Keychain so Unpeel can reopen this workspace. It is never stored on the remote machine or passed in command arguments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存在本机钥匙串，以便 Unpeel 重新打开此工作区。不会存于远程机器或传入命令参数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the remote machine": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在远程机器上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel could not be started. Install it with the same SSH connection, or copy the command as a fallback:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启动 Unpeel。请用同一 SSH 连接安装，或复制以下命令作为备用："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Unpeel is missing, Connect will offer to install it. Manual fallback:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若未安装 Unpeel，连接时会提示安装。手动备用："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install & Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装并连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Supports ordinary SSH and interactive-only managed shells automatically.\nNo service needs to run on the box — Unpeel connects over SSH on demand. For phone access and notifications while disconnected, also run `unpeel serve` there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动支持普通 SSH 与仅交互的管理 shell。\n机器上无需常驻服务 — Unpeel 按需经 SSH 连接。若要在断开时用手机访问和通知，也请在那里运行 `unpeel serve`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel is not available on this SSH Host yet, or could not be started. Install it and connect again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 SSH Host 上尚无 Unpeel，或无法启动。请安装后重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has no hooks or MCP configuration Unpeel can register; Unpeel still recognizes it by name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有 Unpeel 可注册的钩子或 MCP 配置；Unpeel 仍可通过名称识别它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is installed without its Unpeel integration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已安装但未配置 Unpeel 集成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — run `unpeel browser install` on the Host to retry (it re-verifies the pinned agent-browser %@ by sha256).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — 在 Host 上运行 `unpeel browser install` 重试（会按 sha256 重新校验固定的 agent-browser %@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d agents are installed without their Unpeel integration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 个智能体已安装但未配置 Unpeel 集成"
