    "Show": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show %@ details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示 %@ 详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show agent cursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示智能体光标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show an approval dialog the first time a session writes to one of your other sessions. Approvals are remembered per pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话首次写入你的其他会话时显示批准对话框。按配对记住批准结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show browser window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示浏览器窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Site access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting terminal on this Host…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在此 Host 上启动终端…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Host is downloading and verifying agent-browser %@. Browser tools become available as soon as it finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host 正在下载并校验 agent-browser %@。完成后浏览器工具即可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Host service has not published an engine state yet (no serve.json). Once it is running it installs the engine on its own; `unpeel browser install` does the same by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host 服务尚未发布引擎状态（无 serve.json）。运行后会自行安装引擎；也可手动运行 `unpeel browser install`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser runs in the background — screenshots still work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器在后台运行 — 截图仍可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Host does not support installing integrations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Host 不支持安装集成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Host runs with UNPEEL_BROWSER_ENGINE_INSTALL=0, so it never installs the engine itself. Run `unpeel browser install` on the Host, or set UNPEEL_AGENT_BROWSER_BIN to an engine binary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Host 设置了 UNPEEL_BROWSER_ENGINE_INSTALL=0，不会自行安装引擎。在 Host 上运行 `unpeel browser install`，或设置 UNPEEL_AGENT_BROWSER_BIN 为引擎二进制路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Sessions use or Browser use under Features to configure agent access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「功能」中开启 Sessions 使用或 Browser 使用以配置智能体权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel Apps that open files and resources in a pane beside your agents. Install and update them here; develop your own with `unpeel apps link`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在智能体旁窗格中打开文件与资源的 Unpeel App。在此安装与更新；用 `unpeel apps link` 开发你自己的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel integration installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 集成已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel integration not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 集成未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update %@ to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 %@ 更新到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update Unpeel on this Host to reorder %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此 Host 上更新 Unpeel 以重新排序 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View installation instructions for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看 %@ 的安装说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What connected agents may do through Unpeel's tools: read and type into your other sessions, drive a real browser, prepare worktrees, and publish to the gallery. Reads are open; every write follows the policies here. This is a cooperative policy for agents using Unpeel's tools, not a sandbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接智能体通过 Unpeel 工具可执行的操作：读取并向其他会话输入、操控真实浏览器、准备工作树、发布到画廊。读取开放；每次写入遵循此处策略。这是使用 Unpeel 工具的智能体协作策略，而非沙箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happens when a session writes to another session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话写入另一会话时的行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it: busy and idle are read from the screen; no done notifications, transcripts, precise resume, or Unpeel tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无集成时：忙碌/空闲来自屏幕；无完成通知、对话记录、精确恢复或 Unpeel 工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it: identity and tint only; no busy and idle, done notifications, transcripts, precise resume, or Unpeel tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无集成时：仅有身份与色调；无忙碌/空闲、完成通知、对话记录、精确恢复或 Unpeel 工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write approvals you've granted. Each lives until either session is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已授予的写入批准。任一会话移除前一直有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing to other sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入其他会话"
          }
        }
      }
