    "How much of the conversation to include.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含多少对话内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcript content": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话记录内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What \"Copy transcript\" (right-click a session) puts on the clipboard as Markdown. These options also drive the defaults for agents reading a session's transcript. Range is the default for agent reads; the Copy transcript menu picks its own range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「复制对话记录」（右键会话）以 Markdown 放入剪贴板的内容。这些选项也驱动智能体读取会话对话记录的默认值。「范围」是智能体读取的默认值；复制菜单可自选范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@'s notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 %@ 的通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flag menus waiting for a choice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标记等待选择的菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the yellow attention dot when an agent draws a pick-an-option menu. These prompts send no signal on their own, so Unpeel reads them off the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当智能体绘制“选择选项”菜单时显示黄色注意圆点。这些提示本身不发信号，因此 Unpeel 从屏幕读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a session is waiting for you to answer an on-screen menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当会话等待你回答屏幕上的菜单时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@'s features": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 %@ 的功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experimental": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实验性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the selected Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选 Host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Controllers look while scoped to %@. The Host stores these values, so another Mac or phone uses the same workspace appearance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作用域为 %@ 时 Controller 的外观。Host 存储这些值，因此另一台 Mac 或手机使用相同的工作区外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to this Controller's window, sidebar and terminal colors while %@ is active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 处于活动状态时，应用于此 Controller 的窗口、侧栏与终端颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Washes the Controller chrome and identifies %@ in workspace pickers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 Controller 边框上色，并在工作区选择器中标识 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose which Host-side App opens each supported type in this workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择在此工作区中由哪个 Host 端 App 打开各支持的类型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controls this Controller's background and terminal surface whenever %@ is selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每当选中 %@ 时，控制此 Controller 的背景与终端表面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fonts render on this Mac, so this is this Controller's own setting: it applies to %@'s terminals and every other workspace alike. ⌘+ and ⌘− zoom all panes; ⌘0 returns to %d pt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体在本机渲染，因此这是此 Controller 自己的设置：同样应用于 %@ 的终端及其他所有工作区。⌘+ / ⌘− 缩放所有窗格；⌘0 恢复为 %d pt。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@'s appearance…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 %@ 的外观…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How %@ flags sessions that need you, plus delivery diagnostics for this Controller Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 如何标记需要你关注的会话，以及此 Controller Mac 的送达诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the yellow attention dot when an agent draws a pick-an-option menu on the Host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当智能体在 Host 上绘制“选择选项”菜单时显示黄色注意圆点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied by the Host to its session activity before every Controller receives it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 Host 在会话活动送达每个 Controller 之前应用。"
