    "Share This Workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享此工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享此 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controller paired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controller 已配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The displayed one-time code has been consumed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示的一次性代码已使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair Another Controller": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对另一台 Controller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan or paste this code into another Unpeel device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描或将此代码粘贴到另一台 Unpeel 设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code expires in five minutes and can be used once. After pairing, that Controller receives its own revocable device token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码五分钟后过期且只能使用一次。配对后，该 Controller 获得自己的可撤销设备令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or connect from a terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "或从终端连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run this on another machine with the Unpeel CLI installed (curl -fsSL https://unpeel.com/install.sh | sh). It rides your normal SSH access instead of a pairing code, so this Mac needs Remote Login on (System Settings ▸ General ▸ Sharing) and your SSH config must reach it — over a VPN or Tailscale too, but never through Unpeel Link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已安装 Unpeel CLI 的另一台机器上运行（curl -fsSL https://unpeel.com/install.sh | sh）。它走普通 SSH 访问而非配对码，因此本机需开启远程登录（系统设置 ▸ 通用 ▸ 共享），且 SSH 配置需能到达它 — 也可经 VPN 或 Tailscale，但不要经 Unpeel Link。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair a Device with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将设备与 %@ 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device pairs with %@ only — each workspace pairs its own devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备仅与 %@ 配对 — 每个工作区各自配对设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair Another Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对另一台设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@… Its instance starts in the background if it isn't running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 %@… 若未运行，其实例会在后台启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code expires in five minutes and can be used once. The device then holds its own revocable entry in %@'s device list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码五分钟后过期且只能使用一次。设备随后在 %@ 的设备列表中保有自己的可撤销条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is on Link — every connection stays direct, on your own network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未使用 Link — 所有连接都保持直连，在你自己的网络上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中继"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Link…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到 Link…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reachable outside your network (Unpeel Link)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在网络外访问（Unpeel Link）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Unpeel flags a session that needs you and when it sends a notification banner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 如何标记需要你关注的会话，以及何时发送通知横幅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This workspace uses the default workspace's notification settings until a setting below is changed. Revert drops its own values.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此工作区在更改下方某项设置前使用默认工作区的通知设置。还原会丢弃其自己的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send a test Mac notification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送测试 Mac 通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send a test phone notification": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送测试手机通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired phone tokens": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对手机令牌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last phone push": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次手机推送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last attempt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次尝试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Unpeel's optional features on or off — no restart needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开或关闭 Unpeel 的可选功能 — 无需重启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This workspace uses the default workspace's features until a toggle below is changed. Revert drops its own values.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此工作区在更改下方某项开关前使用默认工作区的功能。还原会丢弃其自己的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No optional features right now. Check back after an update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前没有可选功能。更新后再来看看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resource usage, cleanup, and on-disk data for Unpeel's terminal hosts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 终端主机的资源占用、清理与磁盘数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions that have stayed idle for the selected time are stopped — the same as clicking \"Stop\": the terminal stops and the row stays in the sidebar, where Resume continues the conversation. Sessions that keep working (including loops — any activity resets the clock), or that are pinned, selected, unread, or waiting for input, are left alone; plain shell terminals are never touched. Each project keeps its newest stopped sessions up to the limit; older ones are removed automatically, except pinned and unread ones. The agent's own history (for example claude --resume) still has those conversations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲达到所选时长的会话会被停止 — 与点击「停止」相同：终端停止，侧栏中的行保留，可「继续」对话。仍在工作的会话（含循环 — 任何活动都会重置计时），或已置顶、选中、未读、等待输入的会话不受影响；普通 shell 终端永不触碰。每个项目按上限保留最新已停止会话；更旧的会自动移除（置顶与未读除外）。智能体自身历史（例如 claude --resume）仍保留那些对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current process memory usage and active session counts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前进程内存占用与活动会话数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live terminal hosts sorted by current CPU usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按当前 CPU 使用率排序的活动终端主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running Terminals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行中的终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PID %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PID %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d proc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hooks trace log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钩子跟踪日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick access to Unpeel's on-disk session data and hook trace log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快速访问 Unpeel 磁盘上的会话数据与钩子跟踪日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blank shell": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空白 shell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove from Link": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 Link 移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git worktrees": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git 工作树"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions 使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browser use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browser 使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote workspaces": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run sessions in an isolated git worktree of a project so multiple agents can work the same repo in parallel without touching each other's files. Adds worktree controls to the project menu, sidebar, and the Worktrees settings tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在项目的隔离 git 工作树中运行会话，让多个智能体并行处理同一仓库且互不干扰彼此文件。在项目菜单、侧栏与「工作树」设置页加入工作树控件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let an agent session see your other sessions: it can read them all, and asks before writing to another session unless you already approved that pair. These are cooperation controls, not a sandbox against commands running as your macOS user. Adds the Sessions settings tab. Applies when a session starts, so already-running sessions pick it up after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让智能体会话看到你的其他会话：可全部读取，写入另一会话前会询问（除非你已批准该对）。这些是协作控制，不是针对以你的 macOS 用户身份运行命令的沙箱。添加 Sessions 设置页。在会话启动时生效，已在运行的会话需重启后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use extra, fully separate workspaces on this Mac — each workspace has its own sessions, projects, presets, settings, and pairs with your phone as its own workspace. Adds the Workspaces settings tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机使用额外的完全独立工作区 — 每个工作区有各自的会话、项目、预设、设置，并作为独立工作区与手机配对。添加「工作区」设置页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpeel computer use has been retired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpeel 的 Computer use 已停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let agent sessions drive a real browser — open pages, click, fill forms, and take screenshots. Each session gets its own isolated browser with no access to your normal browser profile. Browser access prompts are cooperation controls, not a sandbox against commands running as your macOS user. Adds the Browser settings tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让智能体会话操控真实浏览器 — 打开页面、点击、填写表单、截图。每个会话有独立浏览器，无法访问你的日常浏览器配置。Browser 访问提示是协作控制，不是针对以你的 macOS 用户身份运行命令的沙箱。添加 Browser 设置页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add and control workspaces on other machines — pair another Mac, a headless `unpeel serve` box, or an SSH host — and share this Mac with other devices. Direct connections are for your own network or VPN; Unpeel Link carries the encrypted path when you are away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加并控制其他机器上的工作区 — 配对另一台 Mac、无界面的 `unpeel serve` 主机或 SSH 主机 — 并与其他设备共享本机。直连用于你自己的网络或 VPN；外出时由 Unpeel Link 承载加密路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Early features that are still being shaped. They can change or disappear between releases. Turn one off here if it gets in the way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍在打磨中的早期功能。版本之间可能变更或消失。若碍事可在此关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
